    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends on 1 **unengaged** **PHOBOS** or **SCOUT SQUAD** unit of yours. If it controls an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)**, that **objective** becomes **snared**.\n\nEach time an enemy unit finishes any move within range of a **snared** **objective**, roll a D6: on a 2+, the enemy unit takes D6 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**; either way, the **objective** stops being **snared**.",
